WEBVTT

00:00:00.550 --> 00:00:02.635
Mastery Starter 2.0.

00:00:02.635 --> 00:00:04.480
New to Trading On-Chain?

00:00:04.480 --> 00:00:05.540
Start here.

00:00:05.540 --> 00:00:07.627
In about ten minutes, you'll go from

00:00:07.627 --> 00:00:09.320
zero to ready for this module.

00:00:10.620 --> 00:00:12.629
A swap on a DEX trades against a

00:00:12.629 --> 00:00:15.060
pool of tokens priced by a formula.

00:00:15.060 --> 00:00:17.389
Providing liquidity to that pool earns

00:00:17.389 --> 00:00:19.540
fees but changes what you hold.

00:00:19.540 --> 00:00:21.744
This module teaches you to trade and

00:00:21.744 --> 00:00:24.127
provide liquidity knowing the real cost.

00:00:25.427 --> 00:00:28.882
DEX: a decentralised exchange you use from your wallet.

00:00:28.882 --> 00:00:30.428
Liquidity pool: a pot of

00:00:30.428 --> 00:00:32.707
two tokens traders swap against.

00:00:32.707 --> 00:00:35.989
Price impact: how much your trade moves the price.

00:00:35.989 --> 00:00:38.424
Slippage: the worst price you'll accept.

00:00:38.424 --> 00:00:42.154
Impermanent loss: how far an LP lags simply holding.

00:00:43.453 --> 00:00:45.698
First, Modules 0–1.

00:00:45.698 --> 00:00:48.332
And finally, A little ETH for gas

00:00:48.332 --> 00:00:51.043
and some USDC on a low-fee network.

00:00:52.343 --> 00:00:54.770
Quote a $20 swap on one DEX and on

00:00:54.770 --> 00:00:59.299
an aggregator; compare what you'd actually receive after gas.

00:00:59.299 --> 00:01:00.564
Don't execute yet.

00:01:01.864 --> 00:01:03.818
Beginner: Makes small swaps with

00:01:03.818 --> 00:01:06.604
deliberate slippage and protected routing.

00:01:06.604 --> 00:01:10.493
Practitioner: Calculates fee APR and IL,

00:01:10.493 --> 00:01:13.164
and tracks LP vs holding.

00:01:13.164 --> 00:01:16.892
Master: Uses limit/TWAP/intent orders and

00:01:16.892 --> 00:01:19.378
runs LPs with written rules.

00:01:20.679 --> 00:01:23.264
You've mastered this module when you can

00:01:23.264 --> 00:01:25.281
predict a swap's cost and an LP

00:01:25.281 --> 00:01:28.559
position's result against holding, before you enter.

00:01:29.859 --> 00:01:32.374
Do the checklist now, before you move on.

00:01:32.374 --> 00:01:36.439
Next up, Lesson 2.1: DEXs, aggregators & routing.
